  "description": "Subject: Functional Preprocessing Setup for Subject\u202f001 (rfMRI_REST1_RL)\n\nThe pipeline will be executed with error saving disabled and a full run (no dry\u2011run). We are processing the resting\u2011state fMRI run *rfMRI_REST1_RL* using SE\u2011Based bias correction and MCFLIRT for motion correction. The anatomical registration will use 6 degrees of freedom and the FreeSurfer (FS) registration strategy. The FreeSurfer license key to be applied is **ABCDEF1234567890**.\n\nThe required inputs are as follows: the structural archive is\u202f*sub-001_struct.zip* (type\u202farchive); the primary fMRI time series file is\u202f*sub-001_task-rfMRI_REST1_RL_bold.nii.gz* (NIfTI); the corresponding scout (SBRef) image is\u202f*sub-001_task-rfMRI_REST1_RL_sbref.nii.gz* (NIfTI). Additional auxiliary files include the gradient\u2011coefficient text file\u202f*sub-001_gradcoeff.txt*, the positive and negative spin\u2011echo field maps\u202f*sub-001_SEpos.nii.gz* and\u202f*sub-001_SEneg.nii.gz* (both NIfTI), the Siemens GRE magnitude and phase images\u202f*sub-001_GRE_mag.nii.gz* and\u202f*sub-001_GRE_phase.nii.gz* (NIfTI), and the FreeSurfer license file\u202f*license.txt*.",
  "reference_json": {
    "config": {
      "save-on-error": false,
      "dry-run": false,
      "fMRIName": "rfMRI_REST1_RL",
      "BiasCorrection": "SEBased",
      "MotionCorrection": "MCFLIRT",
      "AnatomyRegDOF": 6,
      "RegName": "FS",
      "FREESURFER_LICENSE": "ABCDEF1234567890"
    },
